	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c48f66e0-7c7f-4057-ad78-ff6f37c2d3e9","type":"text","text":"# Java Collections Framework\nCentral Overview","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":120},
		{"id":"e58eebea-7360-4918-93ce-0a0fbe502bbb","type":"text","text":"# List\n- ArrayList\n- LinkedList\n- Vector (Legacy)\n- Stack (Legacy)\n\nCharacteristics:\n• Ordered\n• Duplicates Allowed\n• Index-based","x":-650,"y":250,"width":350,"height":300},
		{"id":"84dd594f-df1a-45c1-b7d4-dc121f6c2b2f","type":"text","text":"# Set\n- HashSet\n- LinkedHashSet\n- TreeSet\n\nCharacteristics:\n• Unique elements\n• Hash/Linked/Sorted","x":0,"y":250,"width":350,"height":260},
		{"id":"d3ef9f4d-297f-4e5e-848c-226203d252d7","type":"text","text":"# Queue / Deque\n- PriorityQueue\n- ArrayDeque\n- LinkedList\n\nFIFO / Priority / Deque","x":650,"y":250,"width":350,"height":280},
		{"id":"89130138-7bd6-43d0-80d2-d91126764d4e","type":"text","text":"# Map (Separate Hierarchy)\n- HashMap\n- LinkedHashMap\n- TreeMap\n- ConcurrentHashMap\n- Hashtable (Legacy)\n\nKey → Value","x":0,"y":650,"width":400,"height":320},
		{"id":"e357d7bb-ba56-4fe3-a4d4-6e34ff46c267","type":"text","text":"# Time Complexities\nArrayList: Access O(1), Insert O(1)*, Delete O(n)\nLinkedList: Insert/Delete O(1)\nHashSet: O(1)\nTreeSet: O(log n)\nHashMap: O(1)\nTreeMap: O(log n)\nPriorityQueue: add/remove O(log n)","x":-900,"y":700,"width":450,"height":360},
		{"id":"34d53a07-1535-4ee4-b7b8-40d137d36380","type":"text","text":"# Internal Structures\nArrayList → Dynamic Array\nLinkedList → Doubly Linked List\nHashMap → Hash Table\nTreeMap/TreeSet → Red-Black Tree\nPriorityQueue → Binary Heap","x":900,"y":700,"width":450,"height":360},
		{"id":"44da9063-4206-44bd-bc16-eda9b1ff6ca2","type":"text","text":"# Which Collection?\nNeed duplicates → List\nUnique elements → Set\nKey-Value → Map\nSorted → TreeSet/TreeMap\nFast lookup → HashMap\nRandom access → ArrayList\nFrequent insert/delete → LinkedList\nLIFO → ArrayDeque\nFIFO → ArrayDeque","x":0,"y":1100,"width":500,"height":340},
		{"id":"5bf2c431-dfa7-4349-969b-bedb517da3a0","type":"text","text":"# Interview Topics\n• HashMap internals\n• Comparable vs Comparator\n• Fail-fast vs Fail-safe\n• HashMap treeification\n• ArrayList vs LinkedList\n• ConcurrentHashMap\n• Why TreeSet no null?\n• ArrayDeque vs Stack","x":700,"y":1100,"width":450,"height":360},
		{"id":"61f2aa12-cd28-4bc0-87e2-889a4e5c4464","type":"text","text":"# Legacy → Modern\nVector → ArrayList\nStack → ArrayDeque\nHashtable → ConcurrentHashMap\nEnumeration → Iterator","x":-700,"y":1100,"width":420,"height":260},
		{"id":"7cb275a71a16b378","x":-600,"y":-1040,"width":1440,"height":680,"type":"text","text":"┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                                        JAVA COLLECTIONS FRAMEWORK (Java 8+)                                                │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n                                             Iterable\n                                                 │\n                                            Collection\n          ┌──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┐\n          │                                      │                                      │\n        List                                   Queue                                   Set\n          │                                      │                                      │\n ┌────────┼─────────┐                  ┌─────────┼─────────────┐               ┌────────┼───────────┐\n │        │         │                  │         │             │               │        │           │\nArrayList LinkedList Vector       PriorityQueue ArrayDeque  LinkedList     HashSet LinkedHashSet TreeSet\n                     │                                   │\n                  Stack (Legacy)                     Deque Interface\n\n\n                                                Map (Separate Hierarchy)\n                                                       │\n                             ┌───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────┐\n                             │               │               │               │\n                          HashMap      LinkedHashMap      TreeMap    ConcurrentHashMap\n                             │\n                        Hashtable (Legacy)"},
		{"id":"79347ab42aa88c1a","x":-640,"y":1608,"width":960,"height":4672,"type":"text","text":"                                   JAVA COLLECTIONS FRAMEWORK\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n                                     Iterable\n                                         │\n                                  Collection<E>\n        ┌────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┐\n        │                            │                             │\n      List                         Queue                         Set\n        │                            │                             │\n ┌──────┼─────────┐          ┌────────┼──────────┐         ┌────────┼─────────────┐\n │      │         │          │        │          │         │        │             │\nArrayList LinkedList Vector  PriorityQueue ArrayDeque     HashSet LinkedHashSet TreeSet\n                  │\n             Stack (Legacy)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n                                       Map<K,V>\n                                          │\n                  ┌──────────────┬──────────────┬───────────────┐\n                  │              │              │\n              HashMap      LinkedHashMap     TreeMap\n                  │\n            ConcurrentHashMap\n                  │\n             Hashtable (Legacy)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nLIST\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nArrayList\n✔ Dynamic Array\n✔ Fast Random Access\n✔ Slow Insert/Delete in Middle\n✔ Allows duplicates\n✔ Allows null\n✔ Ordered\n\nLinkedList\n✔ Doubly Linked List\n✔ Fast Insert/Delete\n✔ Slow Random Access\n✔ Implements Queue & Deque\n\nVector\n✔ Synchronized\n✔ Legacy\n\nStack\n✔ LIFO\n✔ Legacy\n✔ Prefer ArrayDeque\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSET\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nHashSet\n✔ Hash Table\n✔ Unordered\n✔ No duplicates\n✔ One null allowed\n✔ O(1)\n\nLinkedHashSet\n✔ Maintains insertion order\n✔ O(1)\n\nTreeSet\n✔ Red-Black Tree\n✔ Sorted\n✔ No null\n✔ O(log n)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nQUEUE\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nPriorityQueue\n✔ Heap\n✔ Natural ordering\n✔ O(log n)\n\nArrayDeque\n✔ Circular Array\n✔ Queue + Stack\n✔ Faster than Stack\n\nLinkedList\n✔ Queue\n✔ Deque\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nMAP\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nHashMap\n✔ Hash Table\n✔ One null key\n✔ Multiple null values\n✔ O(1)\n\nLinkedHashMap\n✔ Insertion/Access Order\n✔ Used in LRU Cache\n\nTreeMap\n✔ Red-Black Tree\n✔ Sorted Keys\n✔ O(log n)\n✔ No null keys\n\nConcurrentHashMap\n✔ Thread Safe\n✔ High Performance\n\nHashtable\n✔ Legacy\n✔ Synchronized\n✔ No nulls\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nTIME COMPLEXITIES\n\n                     get      add      remove      search\n----------------------------------------------------------\nArrayList            O(1)     O(1)*      O(n)       O(n)\nLinkedList           O(n)     O(1)       O(1)       O(n)\nHashSet              —        O(1)       O(1)       O(1)\nLinkedHashSet        —        O(1)       O(1)       O(1)\nTreeSet              —      O(log n)   O(log n)   O(log n)\nHashMap             O(1)     O(1)       O(1)       O(1)\nTreeMap          O(log n) O(log n)   O(log n)   O(log n)\nPriorityQueue        O(1)   O(log n)   O(log n)     O(n)\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nWHEN TO USE?\n\nNeed random access?           → ArrayList\nMany insert/delete?           → LinkedList\nUnique elements?              → HashSet\nSorted unique data?           → TreeSet\nFIFO Queue?                   → ArrayDeque\nPriority based?               → PriorityQueue\nFast key lookup?              → HashMap\nOrdered Map?                  → LinkedHashMap\nSorted Map?                   → TreeMap\nThread-safe Map?              → ConcurrentHashMap\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nLEGACY CLASSES\n✔ Vector\n✔ Stack\n✔ Hashtable\n\nPrefer\nVector     → ArrayList\nStack      → ArrayDeque\nHashtable  → ConcurrentHashMap\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSORTING\nCollections.sort(list)\nList.sort()\nArrays.sort()\nComparable\nComparator\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nITERATION\nIterator\nListIterator\nfor-each\nStream API\nSpliterator\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nJAVA 8+ ADDITIONS\n\ncompute()\ncomputeIfAbsent()\ncomputeIfPresent()\nmerge()\nreplaceAll()\nforEach()\nremoveIf()\nstream()\nparallelStream()"}
	],
